  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879980",
      "title": "Rendering a Loading Spinner",
      "lectureOrder": 255,
      "videoOrder": 227,
      "sourceHash": "b0242874d5214cdf8c3d4fb8a6d17e0947e3c5e1e7deaa2878d0a0292d8d5a30",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.05,
          "end": 3.778,
          "en": "At the moment when we visit All Coaches,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.778,
          "end": 7.75,
          "en": "we get no feedback that we're fetching new coaches,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.75,
          "end": 10.27,
          "en": "that we're loading coaches in the background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.27,
          "end": 13.23,
          "en": "In addition, we don't have any error handling in place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.23,
          "end": 14.913,
          "en": "and that's also not optimal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.79,
          "end": 17.96,
          "en": "So it would be great if we could do both,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.96,
          "end": 19.59,
          "en": "check the current loading status",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.59,
          "end": 21.623,
          "en": "and also add error handling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.54,
          "end": 24.55,
          "en": "And of course, I wanna do that into components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.55,
          "end": 28.19,
          "en": "because that is where I wanna update DUI, eventually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.19,
          "end": 31.75,
          "en": "but we're sending the HTTP request in the Vue X store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.75,
          "end": 34.22,
          "en": "So that kind of clashes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.22,
          "end": 37.3,
          "en": "Well, not necessarily, thankfully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.3,
          "end": 40.3,
          "en": "Let's start with fetching coaches,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.3,
          "end": 43.643,
          "en": "because that is easiest to test for us here at the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.55,
          "end": 46.23,
          "en": "We wanna show a loading spinner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.23,
          "end": 48.56,
          "en": "whilst we're fetching coach data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.56,
          "end": 50.49,
          "en": "so that we don't have this flickering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.49,
          "end": 52.183,
          "en": "whenever we reload the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.05,
          "end": 56.53,
          "en": "hence we, first of all, need a loading spinner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.53,
          "end": 59.07,
          "en": "Now, I prepared a complete component for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.07,
          "end": 60.48,
          "en": "Which you'll find attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.48,
          "end": 65.48,
          "en": "The base spinner zip file holds this Base Spinner Vue file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.77,
          "end": 68.893,
          "en": "which you can copy into your UI components folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.42,
          "end": 72.25,
          "en": "The base spinner component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.25,
          "end": 75.82,
          "en": "in the end just renders a loading spinner on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.82,
          "end": 78.92,
          "en": "It's a bunch of markup and a bunch of CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.92,
          "end": 82.08,
          "en": "And we can use this base spinner here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.08,
          "end": 86.57,
          "en": "to render it on the coaches list page whilst we're loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.57,
          "end": 87.94,
          "en": "Now, thankfully, as I said,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.94,
          "end": 90.74,
          "en": "we can find out if we're loading or not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.74,
          "end": 94.91,
          "en": "even though the request is being sent with help of Vue X,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.91,
          "end": 96.72999999999999,
          "en": "because when you dispatch an action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.72999999999999,
          "end": 99.61,
          "en": "there is a nice feature, which I haven't shown you before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.61,
          "end": 102.8,
          "en": "because we didn't really need it before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.8,
          "end": 105.7,
          "en": "This patch can also return something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.7,
          "end": 108.08,
          "en": "to the component where you call it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 108.08,
          "end": 109.78999999999999,
          "en": "And for example, here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.78999999999999,
          "end": 112.99000000000001,
          "en": "when we dispatch the Load Coaches action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.99000000000001,
          "end": 115.43,
          "en": "since we use async keyword here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.43,
          "end": 118.56,
          "en": "it automatically returns a promise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.56,
          "end": 123.06,
          "en": "which we'll resolve once we're done with all these steps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.06,
          "end": 124.89,
          "en": "And that's great because that means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.89,
          "end": 128.59,
          "en": "since this promise is returned that in coach's list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.59,
          "end": 133.04,
          "en": "we can basically listen for this promise completion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.04,
          "end": 135.55,
          "en": "and we know that when it is completed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.55,
          "end": 136.98,
          "en": "we're not loading anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.49,
          "end": 141.63,
          "en": "because then we clearly got a response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.63,
          "end": 144.55,
          "en": "Hence, we can add a new data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.55,
          "end": 148.68,
          "en": "in the Coaches List component next to active filters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 148.68,
          "end": 151.46,
          "en": "and that's the IsLoading property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.46,
          "end": 153.26,
          "en": "which initially is false, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.606,
          "end": 159.06,
          "en": "And IsLoading, this data property, should be set to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.32999999999998,
          "end": 164.69,
          "en": "in the load coach method when this method is executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.69,
          "end": 167.32,
          "en": "So here it then set this to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.32,
          "end": 172.29,
          "en": "Then we dispatch the action where the request is sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.29,
          "end": 173.8,
          "en": "And once this is done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 173.8,
          "end": 177.52,
          "en": "once this promise returned by dispatch resolves,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.52,
          "end": 179.483,
          "en": "we know we no longer are loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.36,
          "end": 183.48,
          "en": "So since dispatch here returns a promise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.48,
          "end": 185.59,
          "en": "we can also use Async Await here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.59,
          "end": 188.09,
          "en": "to wait for this promise to complete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 188.09,
          "end": 190.963,
          "en": "and then set IsLoading to false thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 192.68,
          "end": 195.663,
          "en": "So this will then be set to false once the request is done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197,
          "end": 199.763,
          "en": "and that will allow us to show a loading spinner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.7,
          "end": 205.63,
          "en": "Maybe here above the unordered list, we can add a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.78,
          "end": 210.04,
          "en": "where we check with v-if if we are loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.04,
          "end": 212.75,
          "en": "so that this is only added if we are loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.75,
          "end": 215.46,
          "en": "And then I render my base spinner here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.46,
          "end": 217.873,
          "en": "this loading spinner component I just gave you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.93,
          "end": 222.53,
          "en": "We now just have to register this in main JS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 222.53,
          "end": 227.53,
          "en": "So here in Maine JS, we import the Base Spinner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.63,
          "end": 230.937,
          "en": "from ./components/UI/BaseSpinner.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 234.16,
          "end": 237.42000000000002,
          "en": "and register it as a global component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.42000000000002,
          "end": 242.083,
          "en": "with app component pointing at base spinner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 243.42,
          "end": 245.83,
          "en": "So now the base spinner is available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 245.83,
          "end": 247.06,
          "en": "and in Coaches List,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 247.06,
          "end": 249.913,
          "en": "we are rendering it here if we are loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 251.88,
          "end": 253.13,
          "en": "Now, that also means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 253.13,
          "end": 258.13,
          "en": "I wanna adjust my hasCoaches computed property here a bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 258.85,
          "end": 262.35,
          "en": "because this list should, of course, only be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 262.35,
          "end": 265.72,
          "en": "if we have coaches and we're not loading at the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.72,
          "end": 268.55,
          "en": "so that it disappears if we are loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 268.55,
          "end": 272.39,
          "en": "So in the hasCoaches computed property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 272.39,
          "end": 274.95,
          "en": "we should adjust this a little bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 274.95,
          "end": 278.43,
          "en": "and I'm not just check this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 278.43,
          "end": 282.27,
          "en": "but also check that we're not loading at the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 282.27,
          "end": 284.75,
          "en": "So add this to the computed property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 284.75,
          "end": 287.653,
          "en": "so that if we are loading, we never show the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 290.541,
          "end": 295.541,
          "en": "So that if I save this, now we see that loading spinner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 295.58,
          "end": 298.45,
          "en": "Now it's only there briefly because this is all super quick,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 298.45,
          "end": 301.44,
          "en": "but hey, at least we see it briefly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 301.44,
          "end": 305.64,
          "en": "We also briefly see No Coaches Found",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 305.64,
          "end": 308.82,
          "en": "because we show this whenever the list is not rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 308.82,
          "end": 311.63,
          "en": "And at the moment, this of course means that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 311.63,
          "end": 314.72,
          "en": "it's always rendered whilst we're loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 314.72,
          "end": 316.28,
          "en": "So the list is not rendered then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 316.28,
          "end": 317.97,
          "en": "but this isn't always rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 317.97,
          "end": 322.17,
          "en": "But we can fix this by turning this from v-if to v-else-if",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 322.17,
          "end": 324.07,
          "en": "so that we either are loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 324.07,
          "end": 325.67,
          "en": "and showing the loading spinner,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 325.67,
          "end": 328.39,
          "en": "or we have coaches and show those,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 328.39,
          "end": 331.103,
          "en": "or we have none and show this text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 332.14,
          "end": 334.683,
          "en": "And then we only have this spinner here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 336.17,
          "end": 339.58,
          "en": "Now we also see the Register as Coach button flickering,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 339.58,
          "end": 341.78,
          "en": "Of course, that button also shouldn't show up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 341.78,
          "end": 343.08,
          "en": "if we're loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 343.08,
          "end": 347.77,
          "en": "So here, I wanna check, not just if we're not a coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 347.77,
          "end": 350.23,
          "en": "but also we're not loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 350.23,
          "end": 351.67,
          "en": "Only then this should show up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 351.67,
          "end": 354.04,
          "en": "If we are loading, it should not show up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 354.04,
          "end": 356.933,
          "en": "So then if I reload, this button is not flickering.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 357.99,
          "end": 359.27,
          "en": "Okay, perfect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 359.27,
          "end": 361.66,
          "en": "So now we've got this loading spinner here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 361.66,
          "end": 364.16,
          "en": "When I refresh, we also see it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 364.16,
          "end": 366.23,
          "en": "Now, what about error handling?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 366.23,
          "end": 369.06,
          "en": "At the moment if things go wrong,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 369.06,
          "end": 372.88,
          "en": "for example, if I introduce a deliberate error here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 372.88,
          "end": 374.93,
          "en": "by going to the Load Coaches action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 374.93,
          "end": 377,
          "en": "and removing the N at the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 377,
          "end": 381.67,
          "en": "if we get an error, we just see an infinite loading spinner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 381.67,
          "end": 384.06,
          "en": "and we see the error here, but of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 384.06,
          "end": 387.74,
          "en": "our users don't have the developer tools open typically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 387.74,
          "end": 390.12,
          "en": "So we wanna show an error message here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 390.12,
          "end": 392.7,
          "en": "to the user as well in that case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 392.7,
          "end": 395.993,
          "en": "So therefore, error handling is what I wanna implement next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
